    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage in fast-paced driving through bustling streets, around sharp turns and through traffic.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fun racing through destructive enviroments, explosions and much more!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It ain't easy. Police is on your tail. Evade until the extraction plane arrives!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extract before it's too late. The longer you wait the less cash you have left.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/a3f2cbdd80ab859ac124d6215d4f0468.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage in fast-paced driving through bustling streets, around sharp turns and through traffic.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/0c4aa115ae177d4ce69f8ae0573347eb.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fun racing through destructive enviroments, explosions and much more!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/ba32762530f3534364b9b0df98aade47.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It ain't easy. Police is on your tail. Evade until the extraction plane arrives!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.poster.avif?t=1754863484\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.webm?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240570/extras/b2757748ba1c6a5978a586eba5a42a07.mp4?t=1754863484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extract before it's too late. The longer you wait the less cash you have left.",
